// This file keeps the images of the examples out of the
// github.com/edragoev1/pdfjet/v9 Go module, as the fonts and the data files
// are kept out by being the repositories pdfjet-fonts and pdfjet-data, which
// get-fonts-and-data.sh fetches and git ignores, so go get downloads the
// library source only. The directory has no Go code and nothing imports this
// module.
module github.com/edragoev1/pdfjet/images
